[**OpenCAPIF**](https://ocf.etsi.org/) is an open-source implementation of the [Common API Framework (CAPIF)](https://www.etsi.org/technologies/capif) defined by ETSI that enables API exposure and management functionalities.

Below is a summary of the main CAPIF components that have been deployed:
* Vault - Vault HashiCorp component to store credentials used by OpenCAPIF
* Monitoring - Grafana, Loki and Prometheus components to get ready monitoring of CAPIF components
* OpenCAPIF - Register and CCF components

If you need detailed information about OpenCAPIF you can visit the official documentation: https://ocf.etsi.org/documentation/latest/

